  "details": "There was a Beta back when 2022 was Beta that had MSAA settings on Quest from PC build bleed over that worked\n\nIt was nice having the option especially since we have such a range of power for Stand alone VR headsets (Silicon Lotto, Different chips, Display Resolutions) \n\nSo I want a MSAA setting and if possible Resolution Scailing on Stand alone VR\n\nIt would also allow VRC devs to test graphics settings performance easily\n\nI know they just updated VRC so set MSAA from 4x to 2x but having a setting includes being able to turn it off not just up",
